	# Colony tags (0.5.0): what tenants like or hate about the colony as a whole, by building. Criminals hate police
	# and spying anywhere on their colony (Andrzej: "A drug lord tenant wants high security for HIS home, just not
	# police"). A neighbour's own tags count again for the home next to it.
	"colonyTagsById":{
		"patrolhq":["police"], "militarybase":["police"], "highcommand":["police"],
